The maximization of $\frac{r}{(R+r)^{2}}$ is equivalent to the minimization of $\phi(r)=\frac{(R+r)^{2}}{r}=\frac{R^{2}}{r}+2 R+r$. Setting $\frac{d \phi}{d r}=0$, for example, gives the solution $r=R$. Substituting $r=R$ into 7 yields

